# | Advantech ADAM-4056S — 12-Channel Sink-type Isolated Digital Output Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 12)
# | - 12-channel sink-type isolated digital output.
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01 for output state (coil registers — NOT FC03).
# | - FC01 00017-00028 (coil addr 16-27): Digital Output Value ch0-11 (R/W).
# | - FC03 40211 (addr 210): Module Name 1 (R, 0x40 0x56).
# | - FC03 40212 (addr 211): Module Name 2 (R, 0x53 0x00).
# | - FC03 40213 (addr 212): Firmware Version 1 (R).
# | - FC03 40214 (addr 213): Firmware Version 2 (R).
# | - FC03 40215 (addr 214): Comm Safety Enable (R).
# | - FC03 40216 (addr 215): Comm Safety Flag (R).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
# | - NOTE: DO state uses FC01 coils at addr 16-27, not FC03.
